// The exe's resources: its icon (drawn by tools/make-icon.ps1).
//
// Named GLFW_ICON because that is the name GLFW -- which raylib opens its
// window with -- looks for to give the window's title bar and taskbar button
// their icon. Being the exe's only icon, it is also the one Explorer shows for
// the exe, and index 0, which the .sgf association points at for .sgf files
// (see app/Platform.cpp).
GLFW_ICON ICON "icon/goeditor.ico"
